msgstr "https://www.mandrakecrm.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: mandrakecrm.php
msgid "Recover abandoned carts. Email marketing campaigns. Track campaign ROI. Connect your store in minutes. Start free 7-day trial."
msgstr "Recupere carrinhos abandonados. Campanhas de email marketing. Acompanhe ROI. Ligue a sua loja em minutos. Teste grátis 7 dias."

