#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:391
msgid "Abandoned Cart Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperação de Carrinhos Abandonados"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:392
msgid "Automatically recover lost sales with targeted emails to customers who left items in their cart."
msgstr "Recupere automaticamente vendas perdidas com e-mails direcionados para clientes que deixaram itens no carrinho."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:406
msgid "Transactional Emails"
msgstr "E-mails Transacionais"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:407
msgid "Replace default WooCommerce emails with beautiful MandrakeCRM templates: New Account, Processing, On Hold, Completed, Customer Note, Refunded, Cancelled, Failed, and Password Reset."
msgstr "Substitua os e-mails padrão do WooCommerce por lindos templates do MandrakeCRM: Nova Conta, Processando, Em Espera, Concluído, Nota ao Cliente, Reembolsado, Cancelado, Falhou e Redefinir Senha."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:422
msgid "Smart Lead Capture Widgets"
msgstr "Widgets Inteligentes de Captura de Leads"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:423
msgid "Convert visitors into customers with smart widgets: lead capture popups, WhatsApp buttons, and more."
msgstr "Converta visitantes em clientes com widgets inteligentes: popups de captura de leads, botoes de WhatsApp e mais."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:438
msgid "Checkout Marketing Consent"
msgstr "Consentimento de Marketing no Checkout"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:439
msgid "Grow your subscriber list by collecting marketing consent during checkout."
msgstr "Aumente a sua lista de assinantes coletando consentimento de marketing durante o checkout."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:441
#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:449
msgid "Always On"
msgstr "Sempre Ativo"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:446
msgid "Marketing Attribution Tracking"
msgstr "Rastreamento de Atribuição de Marketing"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:447
msgid "Track UTM parameters to measure campaign ROI and attribute sales to your MandrakeCRM campaigns."
msgstr "Rastreie parâmetros UTM para medir o ROI de campanhas e atribuir vendas às suas campanhas do MandrakeCRM."

